{
  "abstract": "For every fixed ζ, ε > 0, a finite simple graph of sufficiently large degree bound Δ and maximum pair codegree at most ζΔ has list chromatic number at most (ζ + ε)Δ. The degree threshold is uniform in the number of vertices and in the lists.",
